  "youtube": {
    "title": "Why You Can't Stop Scrolling.",
    "description": "\"Just to kill time.\" Then a thousand videos a week, and not one real conversation.\n\nA short animated story about doomscrolling and the reason it's so hard to stop: it isn't really about the videos. It's about never having to sit in the silence. The scroll feels like company, but nobody on the screen knows your name.\n\nIf you're stuck in it right now:\n• Charge your phone outside your bedroom.\n• Let yourself be bored for 10 minutes. The urge peaks, then fades.\n• Text one real person today.\n\nLook up. Your life is happening there.\n\nIf this helped, like, share it with someone who needs it, and subscribe for more.\n\n#doomscrolling #selfimprovement #dopamine #screentime #loneliness #animation #motivation",
    "tags": [
